  "cves": [
    {
      "id": "CVE-2025-71421",
      "publishedDate": "2026-09-21T13:43:35.237Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-09-21T13:43:35.237Z",
      "description": "UVdesk core-framework before 1.1.7 contains an improper privilege management vulnerability in the editAgent endpoint that allows agents with agent-management privilege to escalate their own role to administrator. Attackers can submit their own account identifier with a role parameter set to ROLE_ADMIN to gain full administrative control over agents, tickets, and mail configuration.",
      "severity": 7.2,
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：uvdesk core-framework\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
      "references": [
        {
